      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# IREN_MKZ \u2014 Ethernet & Host Network\n\n**Live host-NIC truth from node exporter.** This does not claim switch-port, optic, PFC or fabric-path observability while dedicated Ethernet collectors are down.\n\n[Home](/d/iren_mkz-home?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Command Center](/d/iren_mkz-command-center?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Live Topology](/d/iren_mkz-topology?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Infrastructure](/d/iren_mkz-infrastructure?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [GPU & NVLink](/d/iren_mkz-accelerators?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Fabric, CVT & Cabling](/d/iren_mkz-fabric?${__url_time_range}) \u00b7 [Workloads, Slurm & Validation](/d/iren_mkz-workloads?${__url_time_range})",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "description": "Host network decisions",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "id": 2,
      "panels": [],
      "title": "Host network decisions",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Host interfaces whose node-exporter link state or carrier is currently down.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "count((node_network_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",su=~\"$su\",rack=~\"$rack\",node=~\"$node\",device=~\"bond0|enP.*\"} == 0) or (node_network_carrier{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",su=~\"$su\",rack=~\"$rack\",node=~\"$node\",device=~\"bond0|enP.*\"} == 0)) or on() (count(node_network_up{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",su=~\"$su\",rack=~\"$rack\",node=~\"$node\",device=~\"bond0|enP.*\"}) * 0)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Link / carrier DOWN",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "description": "Carrier-down transition counter increases in the selected range.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5
      },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(node_network_carrier_down_changes_total{cluster=\"IREN_MKZ\",su=~\"$su\",rack=~\"$rack\",node=~\"$node\",device=~\"bond0|enP.*\"}[$__range]))",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Carrier-down changes",
      "type": "stat"
    },
